# Tasks

Project Name: JWT-Based User Authentication System
📝 Project Description 

Build a backend application in Java using Spring Boot where users can register and log in using email + password. Authentication will be done using JWT tokens, and only authenticated users can access protected endpoints.

This is a compact but professional-looking project, ideal for a resume and GitHub portfolio.

🔧 Tech Stack
Feature	Tools
Backend	Java + Spring Boot
Authentication	JWT
ORM / DB	Hibernate + MySQL
Password Security	BCrypt hashing
Testing & Docs	Postman + Swagger UI

🔥 Core Features (only essentials)
✔ Register user
✔ Login user
✔ Hash password before saving
✔ Generate JWT token on login
✔ Protected route that only token holders can access



Your Role – Java Backend:(step by step)

Create a Spring Boot project

Create User entity + connect to MySQL

Implement Register API with password hashing using BCrypt

Implement Login API → verify password → generate JWT token

Create Authentication Filter for validating JWT

Add /profile endpoint that requires auth token

Test everything using Postman

Push to GitHub with proper README


